Perhaps you should't play tourists.  :)

Short of the one non-ascendable thing you can do in the game, there is
nothing as a truely hopeless character, IMHO.

Unless I was in a good fight, I could probably lose most of my equipment
and still have a good chance of ascending, regardless of where I was in
the game.  BoH accidents are an example of this.

I could have most of my stats drop down to an absurdly low level and
still ascend, in the end.  I've had bad strength before, due to low 
level killer bees, and survived before.

I've pissed off the occasional deity and still ascended.

So what is this "hopeless" character?

